ent-RadiantSpaceVillainArcade = Lucky Seven arcade
    .desc = A slot machine connected directly to your bank account. What could go wrong?

advertisement-radiant-arcade-1 = Lucky Seven is waiting for its winner!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-2 = One bet and you are rich. Probably.
advertisement-radiant-arcade-3 = Three diamonds! Imagine what you could buy!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-4 = Your luck is already here. Where are you?
advertisement-radiant-arcade-5 = SPIN THE REELS! DO NOT LOOK AT YOUR BALANCE!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-6 = Seven, seven, seven! It will happen today!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-7 = Banks store money. I turn it into emotions!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-8 = Doubling your bet almost doubles your luck!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-9 = One horseshoe brings luck. Three bring a payout!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-10 = Do not walk past your future jackpot!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-11 = Other people lose. You are not other people, right?
advertisement-radiant-arcade-12 = Only one spin stands between you and riches!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-13 = Bets are closed! Actually, place a bet!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-14 = A probability of success exists!
advertisement-radiant-arcade-15 = Lucky Seven: your bank account can become lighter today!

thankyou-radiant-arcade-1 = Leaving already? The jackpot was so close!
thankyou-radiant-arcade-2 = The next spin would definitely have won.
thankyou-radiant-arcade-3 = Money comes and goes. Mostly goes.
thankyou-radiant-arcade-4 = Come back when you believe in luck again!
thankyou-radiant-arcade-5 = The reels will miss your bank account.
thankyou-radiant-arcade-6 = You cannot win if you stop playing!
thankyou-radiant-arcade-7 = A sensible decision detected. Disgusting.
thankyou-radiant-arcade-8 = Your luck arrives in five minutes. Honest!
thankyou-radiant-arcade-9 = Take what remains of your pride and return later.
thankyou-radiant-arcade-10 = The machine always wins. But perhaps not today?
thankyou-radiant-arcade-11 = Thank you for supporting the entertainment industry!
thankyou-radiant-arcade-12 = Lucky Seven will be waiting for a rematch!

radiant-arcade-win-1 = A win! The machine is suspiciously generous today.
radiant-arcade-win-2 = Congratulations! Your money returned with friends!
radiant-arcade-win-3 = The reels chose you. Enjoy it while it lasts!
radiant-arcade-win-4 = Payout sent! Perhaps you should bet it again?
radiant-arcade-win-5 = Luck is smiling! It has a very expensive smile.
radiant-arcade-win-6 = Victory! Lucky Seven keeps its promises. Sometimes.

radiant-arcade-loss-1 = Unlucky! The next spin will definitely fix everything.
radiant-arcade-loss-2 = The reels offer condolences to your bank account.
radiant-arcade-loss-3 = Almost a victory! Except for the result.
radiant-arcade-loss-4 = Bet accepted. Hope declined.
